%% Gaps:
%% - This is a sealed zirc room, not a public IRC network. No standalone IRC client lives in the repo.
%% - When the page opens a sealed invite, the page holds the room secret. A later wallet method that keeps the secret out of the page is not in the current UI.
%% - Membership change means a new room. There is no automatic rotation in zirc today.
flowchart TB

    Admin["pages/admin.tsx · Usher chat movement"]:::usher --> Chat["UsherChat"]:::usher
    Chat --> Allowed{"Coordinator or usher session open?"}
    Allowed -->|no| Block["Sign in with a ZID on this page after an usher session is open"]:::usher
    Allowed -->|yes| Zid["Select Sign in with ZID"]:::wallet
    Zid --> Seat["Enter Usher seat"]:::usher
    Seat --> Reg["Select Register ZID on the usher set"]:::usher
    Reg --> Room["Select Create or rotate sealed room"]:::usher
    Room --> OpenRoom["zafu/zirc-lab.mjs openLabRoom"]:::chain
    OpenRoom --> Send["Enter Usher message and select Send"]:::usher
    Send --> Log["Usher channel log"]:::usher

